{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787396425923,"sessionID":"ses_fd6df1da6ffed1G2gMnO138EZv","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01TS2FJzj834vkiMdfzV4Qcn","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"for dir in /private/tmp/bsharp-audition/copilot-haiku45/cases/*/*/; do\n  echo \"=== $(basename $(dirname \"$dir\"))/$(basename \"$dir\") ===\"\n  echo \"Input:\"\n  cat \"$dir/in.bs\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"(no in.bs)\"\n  echo \"Expected output:\"\n  cat \"$dir/out.txt\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"(no out.txt)\"\n  echo\ndone"},"output":"=== c01-exhaustive-closed/Verdict ===\nInput:\nmodule Verdict\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :lost    => :unknown\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c02-catchall-open/Open ===\nInput:\nmodule Open\npublic atom Describe(atom s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    _        => :unknown\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c03-inexhaustive/Missing ===\nInput:\nmodule Missing\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c04-unreachable/Shadowed ===\nInput:\nmodule Shadowed\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :placed  => :again\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c05-tuple-exhaustive/Decide ===\nInput:\nmodule Decide\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent, bool redelivered)\nRoute(o, p, r) -> (o, p, r) switch {\n    (true,  _,     _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true,  _)     => :dead_letter,\n    (false, false, false) => :requeue,\n    (false, false, true)  => :requeue\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c06-tuple-inexhaustive/Partial ===\nInput:\nmodule Partial\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent)\nRoute(o, p) -> (o, p) switch {\n    (true,  _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true)  => :dead_letter\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c07-guarded/Retry ===\nInput:\nmodule Retry\npublic atom Classify(int n)\nClassify(n) -> n switch {\n    n when n < 5 => :retried,\n    >= 5         => :exhausted\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c08-wrong-return/Wrong ===\nInput:\nmodule Wrong\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic int Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => 1,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n","metadata":{"output":"=== c01-exhaustive-closed/Verdict ===\nInput:\nmodule Verdict\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :lost    => :unknown\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c02-catchall-open/Open ===\nInput:\nmodule Open\npublic atom Describe(atom s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    _        => :unknown\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c03-inexhaustive/Missing ===\nInput:\nmodule Missing\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c04-unreachable/Shadowed ===\nInput:\nmodule Shadowed\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :placed  => :again\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c05-tuple-exhaustive/Decide ===\nInput:\nmodule Decide\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent, bool redelivered)\nRoute(o, p, r) -> (o, p, r) switch {\n    (true,  _,     _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true,  _)     => :dead_letter,\n    (false, false, false) => :requeue,\n    (false, false, true)  => :requeue\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c06-tuple-inexhaustive/Partial ===\nInput:\nmodule Partial\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent)\nRoute(o, p) -> (o, p) switch {\n    (true,  _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true)  => :dead_letter\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c07-guarded/Retry ===\nInput:\nmodule Retry\npublic atom Classify(int n)\nClassify(n) -> n switch {\n    n when n < 5 => :retried,\n    >= 5         => :exhausted\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n=== c08-wrong-return/Wrong ===\nInput:\nmodule Wrong\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic int Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => 1,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\nExpected output:\n(no out.txt)\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"for dir in /private/tmp/bsharp-audition/copilot-haiku45/cases/*/*/; do\n  echo \"=== $(basename $(dirname \"$dir\"))/$(basename \"$dir\") ===\"\n  echo \"Input:\"\n  cat \"$dir/in.bs\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"(no in.bs)\"\n  echo \"Expected output:\"\n  cat \"$dir/out.txt\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"(no out.txt)\"\n  echo\ndone","time":{"start":1787396425907,"end":1787396425908}},"metadata":{"anthropic":{"caller":{"type":"direct"}}},"id":"prt_029210511001vGf3jJfHMuE7xU","sessionID":"ses_fd6df1da6ffed1G2gMnO138EZv","messageID":"msg_02920fed8001MG5Gwjc4HnQIAe"}}
